<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/05b97fd0-d473-4e54-85ec-1265a05182d8> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Photochemical Synthesis of a Sulfonyl‑Activated Carbamate via 4‑(Trimethyl‑silyl)pyrrolidin‑2‑yl)pentyl‑sulfonyl chloride";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Exploring a visible‑light driven coupling of a silyl‑protected pyrrolidine with a sulfonyl chloride, examining the efficiency of the photoinduced radical opening of the sulfonyl chloride.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/3c8c0c14-4824-4f47-b177-c3f52ddd2f85> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Radical Iodination of Perfluoroalkyl Ether";
    <http://schema.org/description> "This routine evaluates the radical iodination of perfluoro(3‑ethyl‑4‑methyl‑1‑phenyl‑1,2‑bis(ethoxy)ethane) using N‑iodosuccinimide (NIS) and AIBN initiator. The aim is the selective introduction of an iodine atom to generate a perfluoro‑iodo‑species for subsequent cross‑coupling.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/5c018d75-8acf-4692-9022-9af8f5620a45> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset 16 - Synthesis of a Vinyl Sulfone via (1,2‑bis(4‑tert‑butylphenyl)phosphonyl)dimethyl‑4‑methylbenzene";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Formation of a vinyl sulfone by reaction of an alkyl phosphonate with a sulfonyl chloride under basic conditions. The reaction investigates the influence of the tert‑butyl groups on sulfone conjugation.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/6a9bcc37-0b87-4c32-9f77-a90b2c64c4bf> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Thermal Rearrangement of Phosphine‑Ligated Thianone";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Investigating the thermal rearrangement of 2‑(bis(1,2,4‑triazolyl)phosphine)−(3‑tert‑butyl‑1,1‑diphenyl)thianone to form a phosphine-ligated thianone derivative.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/76f91d08-63e1-4240-9aa7-e7f0fd6e6fc2> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Suzuki‑Miyaura Coupling of Pentylchloride and Aromatic Boronate with Palladium Catalyst";
    <http://schema.org/description> "In this experiment the cross‑coupling of pentylchloride with bromodicyclopentylboronate is investigated under Suzuki‑Miyaura conditions to generate a medium‑chain substituted heteroarylboronic acid derivative suitable for late‑stage functionalisation.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/9c98c8fc-be06-496b-b571-889d88a6e52f> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Intramolecular Sulfonylation of a Tricyclic Alkyl Chloride to Form a Cyclic Sulfone";
    <http://schema.org/description> "This study evaluates the intramolecular sulfonylation of 4‑(bromomethyl)‑tricyclo[5.4.0.0⁴,¹⁰]decane using a bifunctional sulfonate reagent derived from (1,3,5‑tris(2,4‑dinitro‑1,3,5‑triazolyl)benzene) under base‑mediated conditions, leading to a novel six‑membered sulfone ring with potential for polymer backbone units.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/9cf68ab8-f077-4a66-8b56-aa2613b4cb85> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset: Oxidative Nitration of (4‑(tert‑butyl)phenyl)­methoxy‑n,n′‑dimethyl‑pyridinium chloride with N,N‑dimethyl‑3‑nitropropanamide";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Explores electrophilic aromatic nitration under oxidative conditions to generate a novel pyridinium nitro derivative. Reaction efficiency and side‑product distribution are quantified.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/9d444d6e-abe2-4459-a14b-62b6db3acd4d> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Trifluoromethylation of Triazine‑Phosphine via Nucleophilic Substitution";
    <http://schema.org/description> "The experiment demonstrates the conversion of 2‑(bis(1,2,4‑triazolyl)phosphine)−(3‑tert‑butyl‑1,1‑diphenyl)thianone to 2‑(trifluoromethyl)-4‑(tert‑butyl)‑1,3,5‑triazine‑2‑yl‑methyl‑imidazolidin‑4‑one using sodium trifluoromethanesulfinate under Suzuki‑type conditions.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/f5416222-e394-46b5-970f-4ad7f9b6ebac> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset 9";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Sulfone formation by condensation of a sulfonyl chloride with a diazo‑containing ester under catalytic conditions.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/fb691439-4d7e-411f-a283-ff84fc788c28> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Formation of a Disulfide from a Bis‑Disulfane";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Reduction of bis(1,3‑diphenyl‑2‑pyridyl)disulfane to the corresponding thiol via a mild reductant (not listed) and subsequent disulfide formation.".

