<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/043e21d1-bf65-4295-b8f9-c26f52f3784b> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset 7: Oxidative Cyclization to Form a Triazole Core";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Examining the oxidative cyclization of a 2‑(bis(1,2,4‑triazolyl)phosphine) ligand with a di-iodinated aromatic to generate a fused triazine triazole scaffold.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/13b1f364-6b6c-41f0-9d29-65cc8b5abbab> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset 7 – Reductive Coupling of Bis(3,5‑Dichloro‑2‑(tert‑butyl)phenyl)bis(1,2,4‑triazole)-3‑thiocarbonyl sulfide with n,n′‑bis(3‑chloro‑4‑methyl‑2‑pyridyl)carbamimidic acid";
    <http://schema.org/description> "A reductive coupling between a thioester and a carbamimidic acid is attempted under photochemical conditions. The reaction progress is monitored by TLC and the product is isolated by recrystallization.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/37594005-3f61-4bcf-922d-cd71381f7a18> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Formation of Bis(1,3‑Diphenyl‑2‑Pyridyl)Disulfane via Coupling";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Synthesis of bis(1,3‑diphenyl‑2‑pyridyl)disulfane by reacting hexamethyl‑4‑(tert‑butyl)benzene‑2,3‑diyl di‑(bromophenyl)borate with (4‑(tert‑butyl)phenyl)methoxy‑n,n′‑dimethyl‑pyridinium chloride under thermal conditions.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/47048c3f-4012-4ca3-b5bb-dff0c6c80715> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset 7 - Synthesis of a Sulfenylated Cyclohexanone via Bis(1,3‑diphenyl‑2‑pyridyl)disulfane";
    <http://schema.org/description> "A sulfur transfer reaction where bis(1,3‑diphenyl‑2‑pyridyl)disulfane reacts with 3‑(1‑benzyl‑piperidin‑4‑yl)cyclohexanone to deliver a sulfenylated cyclohexanone derivative. The study inspects regioselectivity and possible thiyl radical intermediates.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/7b9715ca-ef2a-4311-b502-cb1eff2f41ca> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Condensation to Form a Phosphine";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Synthesis of diethyl‑(phenylhydrazinyl)‑2‑methoxy‑1‑cyclohexylphosphine through condensation of an oxazepine N‑oxide and a boron‑containing heterocycle.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/82a6b97a-e3f9-441f-aa5b-ee71965c3931> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Preparation of a Phosphonium Salt via Sulfonyl Chloride Coupling";
    <http://schema.org/description> "This experiment focuses on generating a phosphonium salt from a sulfonyl chloride and a tertiary amine. The product is a key intermediate in nucleophilic substitution reactions and demonstrates the utility of sulfonylation for constructing phosphonium frameworks.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/a0842ee9-53f8-42bc-9ad6-347ec3bb2914> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset 4 – Hydrosilylation of a Cyclic Ether Using 4‑(trimetyl‑silyl)pyrrolidin-2-yl)pentyl‑sulfonyl chloride";
    <http://schema.org/description> "A silane‑catalyzed addition across the oxacyclic double bond of a 3‑(1‑benzyl‑piperidin‑4‑yl)cyclic ether to generate a novel tetrahydropyran derivative.  The protocol employs a platinum catalyst and triethylsilane as the hydride source.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/a496149e-a83f-4693-a925-ed0976ff5883> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Hydrolysis of Oxazolidinone to Primary Carboxylic Acid";
    <http://schema.org/description> "The goal is the base‑catalyzed hydrolysis of bis(3,5‑difluoro‑4‑methylphenyl)oxazolidin‑2‑one to the corresponding 3‑(difluoro‑methyl)phenylcarboxylic acid. The procedure assesses pH control and product isolation.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/c01ceb75-6748-45a4-a9f9-71f4d465b16e> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Formation of Bis(4‑(tert‑butyl)phenyl)‑4‑chloropyrimidyl‑1‑butyl‑1‑bromide via Alkylation of 4‑(tert‑butyl)phenyl)methoxy‑n,n′‑dimethyl‑pyridinium chloride";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Explores a two‑step alkylation leading to a bis‑chloropyrimidyl bromide, evaluating reagent selectivity and byproduct analysis by NMR and mass spectrometry.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/d1473dd6-46db-4ebb-b8ee-18fb07c43a1c> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset 7";
    <http://schema.org/description> "Cross‑coupling of a benzodioxolo benzothiazole ester with a borate reagent to form a biaryl product.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/ddddd1a8-3805-436e-a9a7-2244b5d8c8f4> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Synthesis of a Biaryl Sulfurylate via Nucleophilic Aromatic Substitution";
    <http://schema.org/description> "An investigation into the regioselectivity of nucleophilic aromatic substitution using bis(2‑(n‑tert‑butoxycarbonyl)phenyl‑methyl‑sulfide) with (4‑(tert‑butyl)phenyl)methoxy‑n,n′‑dimethyl‑pyridinium chloride under basic conditions to prepare a sulfenylated biaryl bearing a sulfonyl chloride functionality.".

