    rdfs:label "Dataset 4 – Thioether Coupling of Bis(1,3‑Diphenyl‑2‑Pyridyl)disulfane and Bromodicyclopentylboronate";
    <http://schema.org/description> "A thioether linkage is created between a disulfide and a bromodicyclopentylboronate under copper catalysis. The resulting organoboron intermediate is isolated and its ^11B NMR spectra recorded.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/9a647184-4a57-4669-ac7e-753ee299e76a> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset 1 – SN2 Substitution of Pentylchloride with 2-(Methylthio)propanol";
    <http://schema.org/description> "This experiment investigates the phase‑to‑phase heteroatom substitution of a primary alkyl chloride by a thio‑alcohol in polar aprotic solvent. The resulting ether is isolated and its purity is evaluated by TLC and ^1H NMR. The kinetic profile is monitored by taking aliquots during the reaction.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/a2f2810a-0fb5-47af-9e58-4457d528d4f4> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset 9 – Synthesis of Tri‑(dinitro‑triazolyl)benzene by Nitration of 1,3,5‑Triazolyl benzene";
    <http://schema.org/description> "A nitration reaction is carried out on 1,3,5‑triazolyl benzene in a mixture of nitric and acetic acids to yield 1,3,5‑tris(2,4‑dinitro‑1,3,5‑triazolyl)benzene. The product is isolated by filtration and its UV‑vis spectrum is recorded.".
<https://hypmol.net/Dataset/bc3c4cc6-76fe-4e30-84f5-cc2d183a2090> a <http://schema.org/Dataset>;
    rdfs:label "Dataset 10 – Photoredox‑Mediated Synthesis of a Sulfide from (3,5‑Dichloro‑2‑(tert‑butyl)phenyl)bis(1,2,4‑triazole)-3‑thiocarbonyl sulfide and 4‑(trimethyl‑silyl)pyrrolidin‑2‑yl)pentyl‑sulfonyl chloride";
    <http://schema.org/description> "The coupling of a thioester and a sulfonyl chloride is achieved under visible‑light photoredox catalysis. The final sulfide is isolated by column chromatography and its ^31P NMR spectrum is recorded.".

